sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Skills Studio
  participant N as Node BFF
  participant API as FastAPI sync APIs
  participant R as Agent Registry
  U->>N: Upload SKILL.md
  N->>N: Session, size and quota checks
  N->>API: Skills CRUD with owner key and skill ID
  API->>API: Validate against approved tool catalog
  alt Unknown tool or MCP server
    API-->>N: 422 with reason
    N-->>U: Show reason
  else Valid
    API->>R: Publish immutable revision (idempotent)
    R-->>API: Revision reference
    API-->>N: Published revision
    N-->>U: Skill available
  end
